{
    "title": "Hooters - Ordering and Rewards",
    "description": "Everything Hooters\u00ae, Right at Your Fingertips\t\r\nThe Hooters\u00ae app puts our wide selection of world-famous wings, fresh burgers, crisp salads, and craveable seafood all in one place \u2013 your pocket! Order from your phone and pick up your order at the location nearest you, or where available, have Hooters\u00ae delivered straight to your door. The app currently serves more than 200 Hooters\u00ae locations nationwide, with additional locations coming online throughout the year.\r\n\r\nA Little Loyalty Goes a Long Way\r\nIntroducing HootClub rewards! The Hooters\u00ae app now allows you to earn and redeem HootClub rewards at more than 200 U.S. locations, online, or in the app. Order. Get rewards. Repeat. \r\n\r\nYour first reward is waiting for you in the app now, and it\u2019s a classic. Get a free appetizer on us when you register today and then earn more free food after every 8th qualifying dine-in visit or online order of $12 or more. You\u2019ll also be treated to other discounts and special offers, like 10 free wings on your birthday every year!\r\n\r\nWant to take it a step further? Invite your friends to join HootClub and you\u2019ll be rewarded with a free appetizer for each friend that signs up after they make their first purchase. \r\n\r\nAnd we\u2019re just getting started.  \r\n\r\nApp Features:\r\n- Hooters\u00ae Location Finder with address, phone number, hours of operation, and pickup / delivery options\r\n- Full Hooters\u00ae Menu for more than 220 locations nationwide\r\n- Save your favorite Hooters location \r\n- Order Scheduling lets you order for fastest pickup now or for a date in the future\r\n- Order history and favorite food items let you quickly re-order next time\r\n- Purchase digital or physical gift cards right within the app\r\n- Personal referral codes to use to invite your friends \u2013 and earn rewards when they join\r\n\r\nMaximum value of free appetizer reward is $8.99. Cannot be combined with other offers. This reward expires 30 days from the date earned. If appetizer cost is higher than $8.99, customer can elect to pay the difference in cost, or choose from other appetizers at or below $8.99.\r\n\r\nFor additional details on HootClub rewards, visit https://www.hooters.com/faqs",
    "descriptionHTML": "Everything Hooters\u00ae, Right at Your Fingertips\t<br>The Hooters\u00ae app puts our wide selection of world-famous wings, fresh burgers, crisp salads, and craveable seafood all in one place \u2013 your pocket! Order from your phone and pick up your order at the location nearest you, or where available, have Hooters\u00ae delivered straight to your door. The app currently serves more than 200 Hooters\u00ae locations nationwide, with additional locations coming online throughout the year.<br><br>A Little Loyalty Goes a Long Way<br>Introducing HootClub rewards! The Hooters\u00ae app now allows you to earn and redeem HootClub rewards at more than 200 U.S. locations, online, or in the app. Order. Get rewards. Repeat. <br><br>Your first reward is waiting for you in the app now, and it\u2019s a classic. Get a free appetizer on us when you register today and then earn more free food after every 8th qualifying dine-in visit or online order of $12 or more. You\u2019ll also be treated to other discounts and special offers, like 10 free wings on your birthday every year!<br><br>Want to take it a step further? Invite your friends to join HootClub and you\u2019ll be rewarded with a free appetizer for each friend that signs up after they make their first purchase. <br><br>And we\u2019re just getting started.  <br><br>App Features:<br>- Hooters\u00ae Location Finder with address, phone number, hours of operation, and pickup / delivery options<br>- Full Hooters\u00ae Menu for more than 220 locations nationwide<br>- Save your favorite Hooters location <br>- Order Scheduling lets you order for fastest pickup now or for a date in the future<br>- Order history and favorite food items let you quickly re-order next time<br>- Purchase digital or physical gift cards right within the app<br>- Personal referral codes to use to invite your friends \u2013 and earn rewards when they join<br><br>Maximum value of free appetizer reward is $8.99. Cannot be combined with other offers. This reward expires 30 days from the date earned. If appetizer cost is higher than $8.99, customer can elect to pay the difference in cost, or choose from other appetizers at or below $8.99.<br><br>For additional details on HootClub rewards, visit https://www.hooters.com/faqs",
